@startuml
!theme mars
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Admin / Teknisi" as User
boundary "Halaman Router" as UI
control "Sistem" as System
database "DB Routers" as DB
participant "MikroTik\nRouter" as MT

== Tambah Router Baru ==

User -> UI : Input data router\n(Nama, IP, Port, User, Password)
activate UI
UI -> System : POST /api/routers
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> System : Validasi kelengkapan data
alt Data Tidak Lengkap
    System --> UI : Error: Data tidak lengkap
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> User : Tampilkan pesan error
    deactivate UI
else Data Lengkap
    System -> System : Enkripsi kata sandi (AES)
    System -> DB : INSERT routers\n(status = checking)
    activate DB
    DB --> System : Kembalikan router_id
    deactivate DB

    System -> MT : Uji koneksi awal\nke RouterOS API
    activate MT

    alt Koneksi Berhasil
        MT --> System : Info RouterOS
        deactivate MT
        System -> DB : UPDATE status = online
        activate DB
        DB --> System : Berhasil
        deactivate DB
        System --> UI : Router ditambahkan\ndan terhubung
        deactivate System
        activate UI
        UI --> User : Tampilkan pesan sukses
        deactivate UI
    else Koneksi Gagal / Timeout
        MT --> System : Error: unreachable
        deactivate MT
        System -> DB : UPDATE status = offline
        activate DB
        DB --> System : Berhasil
        deactivate DB
        System --> UI : Warning: Disimpan,\nkoneksi gagal
        deactivate System
        activate UI
        UI --> User : Peringatan: Cek jaringan
        deactivate UI
    end
end

== Uji Koneksi Router ==

User -> UI : Pilih router & klik Tes Koneksi
activate UI
UI -> System : POST /api/routers/:id/test
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> DB : Ambil data router by ID
activate DB
DB --> System : IP, port, user, password_enc
deactivate DB

alt Router Tidak Ditemukan
    System --> UI : Error: Router tidak ditemukan
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> User : Tampilkan error
    deactivate UI
else Router Ditemukan
    System -> System : Dekripsi kata sandi (AES)
    System -> MT : Buka koneksi ke RouterOS API
    activate MT

    alt Koneksi Berhasil
        MT --> System : Hasil koneksi (latency)
        deactivate MT
        System -> DB : Perbarui status & last_seen_at
        activate DB
        DB --> System : Berhasil
        deactivate DB
        System --> UI : Router online
        deactivate System
        activate UI
        UI --> User : Tampilkan status online
        deactivate UI
    else Koneksi Gagal / Timeout
        MT --> System : Error: ditolak/timeout
        deactivate MT
        System -> DB : UPDATE status = offline
        activate DB
        DB --> System : Berhasil
        deactivate DB
        System --> UI : Koneksi gagal
        deactivate System
        activate UI
        UI --> User : Tampilkan status offline
        deactivate UI
    end
end

== Ubah Konfigurasi Router ==

User -> UI : Edit data router & klik Simpan
activate UI
UI -> System : PUT /api/routers/:id
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> DB : Ambil data router saat ini
activate DB
DB --> System : Data existing
deactivate DB

System -> System : Bandingkan perubahan & validasi
alt Ada Perubahan Kredensial/IP
    System -> System : Enkripsi password baru (AES)
    System -> MT : Verifikasi koneksi\ndengan kredensial baru
    activate MT
    MT --> System : Hasil verifikasi
    deactivate MT
    alt Verifikasi Gagal
        System --> UI : Error: Koneksi gagal\ndengan data baru
        deactivate System
        activate UI
        UI --> User : Update dibatalkan
        deactivate UI
    end
end

System -> DB : UPDATE routers
activate DB
DB --> System : Berhasil
deactivate DB
System --> UI : 200 OK
deactivate System
activate UI
UI --> User : Konfigurasi router diperbarui
deactivate UI

== Hapus Router ==

User -> UI : Pilih router & klik Hapus
activate UI
UI -> System : DELETE /api/routers/:id
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> DB : Cek dependensi\n(subscriptions/customers)
activate DB
DB --> System : Jumlah penggunaan
deactivate DB

alt Masih Digunakan
    System --> UI : Error: Router masih\ndigunakan pelanggan
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> User : Nonaktifkan pelanggan dulu
    deactivate UI
else Tidak Digunakan
    System -> DB : DELETE router
    activate DB
    DB --> System : Berhasil
    deactivate DB
    System --> UI : 200 OK
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> User : Router berhasil dihapus
    deactivate UI
end

note right of User
  Password router dienkripsi AES.
  Dekripsi saat koneksi ke RouterOS.
  Komunikasi via port 8728/8729.
  Status: online, offline, checking.
end note

@enduml